&lt;img alt="Cover of Season of the Witch by George A. Romero." data-caption="" data-portal-copyright="Image: Arrow Films" data-has-syndication-rights="1" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/10/b4cbdcb8-32ec-4f79-8a23-c2edbf8d58e9.jpg?qualit</ns0:content>
			
